@startuml
' AD-025; source ../use-cases/UC-025-share-selected-outfit.md
' Draft v0.1, 2026-11-09; approved PR #4 / DD-007 scope, not implementation.
' Trace: FEAT-COM-002; BR-026; CAP-11; PBI-043; US-COM-002 AC.
' SRS: FR-COM-004, FR-COM-008, FR-COM-009; DATA-COM-001.
' Business Rules: BRULE-COM-001, BRULE-COM-003; BRULE-AUTH-001/007.
' Open policy: MVP-Q01, MVP-Q02, MVP-Q06, MVP-Q09; PRD Section 34.2. No provider / owner allocation selected.
title AD-025 - Explicitly share a selected outfit
skinparam monochrome true
skinparam shadowing false
|User|
start
:Deliberately start UC-025;
|CapsuleAI|
if (Source / affected-user access authorized?) then (Yes)
  :Identify intended source and user context;
else (Denied / unusable)
  :Explain access state; disclose no private data;
  :Offer renewed access or accessible source;
  stop
endif
|CapsuleAI|
:Present approved outfit / creator / media projection
and approved sharing audience;
|User|
:Review disclosure;
if (Explicitly confirm sharing?) then (Yes)
  |CapsuleAI|
  :Check creator authority and approved sharing policy;
  :Attempt publication of selected representation;
  if (Acceptance established?) then (Yes)
    :Show attributed shared post;
  else (Failed / uncertain)
    :Preserve known accepted state;
    :Explain failed or unconfirmed publication;
    :Offer outcome review / safe retry;
  endif
else (Cancel)
  |CapsuleAI|
  :Publish nothing from canceled intention;
endif
note right
  Audience, consent, fields and lifecycle remain open.
  Approve relevant policy before this Draft is Ready.
  No entire wardrobe or private source media is exposed.
end note

stop
@enduml
